---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="p-8 max-w-sm bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-gray-200 transition transform hover:scale-105 duration-300">
      <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2">🎉 Phase 3 クリア！</div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        VSCodeからリモート編集し、TailwindCSSのスタイルが完全に反映されました。爆速開発環境の完成です！
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6">
        <span class="inline-block bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold">Linux Mint</span>
        <span class="inline-block bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold ml-2">Astro</span>
        <span class="inline-block bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-semibold ml-2">Tailwind</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>